<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN ASLK/CGER H1 LIFE INSURANCE EARNINGS JUMP.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN ASLK/CGER H1 LIFE INSURANCE EARNINGS JUMP.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian-Dutch bankassurance group Fortis said on Thursday earnings from life insurance by its Belgian unit ASLK/CGER Insurance jumped in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;ASLK-CGER Insurance achieved a substantially higher result in life insurance,&quot; Fortis said in a statement.</p>
<p>AG 1824 by contrast mainly had a better result in accident and health insurance business.</p>
<p>ASLK/CGER Insurance sold fewer insurance coupons -- life insurances with a savings element -- but premium income in Belgium on the whole increased as a result of higher sales at AG 1824, in particular in life business.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
